SHOP SUMMARY — ERMAKSAN SPEED BEND PRO:

  Core Formula (air bending):
    BD  = (2 × OSB) - BA
    OSB = tan(Angle/2) × (R + T)
    BA  = (Angle × π/180) × (R + K × T)

  J-Flange Reference Values (0.1875" Al, R=0.125"):
